🚨 Announcemenet Alert 🚨 Bad Boombox is back at Nitsa on November 6th for a @hotmealrecords takeover, joined by MIJA & lizaliza 🕺👯‍♀️

Berlin-based Bulgarian-American DJ and producer @badboombox has become a formidable force since emerging in 2012, bringing light, fun, color and energy back to the techno scene with his playful mix of bouncy, groovy house, hard house and trance.

@hi_mija is a multidisciplinary DJ and producer exploring the sounds of hardgroove and techno. Blending disco, classic house, funk and high-energy rave influences, her sets and productions balance playful grooves with harder, faster rhythms. 

@lizalliiza is a music producer and DJ blending house, lo-fi, hard groove and hard house. Her sound combines warm melodies, distinctive vocal samples and driving grooves, moving effortlessly between peak-time energy and experimental textures.

